{"id":"vod_bf_6379","vodId":"6379","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"丹特丽安的书架","name_cn":"丹特丽安的书架","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-7/b2d02bc945b7210d21253753e5cb369a.jpg"},"summary":"修伊（小野大辅 配音）出身贵族，他爷爷是个热衷于收藏各种珍贵书籍的收书狂，死于意外后便留下一座古老的庄园和满屋子的藏书。爷爷的遗嘱写道，想要继承他的宅邸，条件就是继承丹特丽安的书架。修伊收信后造访宅邸，在地下室的书堆中遇到一名神秘少女达利安（泽城美雪 配音）。　　因为调查爷爷死因，修伊来到了康拉德的宅邸，看到因幻书而引发的可怕景象。“幻书”即不该存在的梦幻之书，它蕴含着强大的禁断力量，能赐予读者无尽恩惠，但也会颠覆世界令其崩溃。封印幻书的，就是丹特丽安的书架。达利安命令修伊拿出钥匙，诵读咒文，她胸前的巨锁闪烁着金属光泽，原来少女达利安就是通往丹特丽安的书架的入口……　　本动画改编自作家三云岳斗的同名轻小说。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 17:52:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/danteliandeshujia/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026